{"673100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Code of The Savage", "steam_appid": 673100, "required_age": "17", "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;Sails on the horizon... Why they came, we did not know... Destruction, chains...&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Code of The Savage</strong> is a dark fantasy RPG about vengeance, survival, and carving your own path through a brutal world. After escaping a slave ship, you wash ashore in chains on the island kingdom of Daneth. Alone and hunted, you must fight to survive in a land where cruelty is common and easy answers are rare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/243e2a952f43e86246c2cf804bdffed2.poster.avif?t=1787829012\" width=950 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/243e2a952f43e86246c2cf804bdffed2.webm?t=1787829012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/243e2a952f43e86246c2cf804bdffed2.mp4?t=1787829012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the great RPGs of the 80s and 90s, Code of The Savage combines classic non-linear exploration with a modern presentation. The world of Daneth is hand-crafted and designed to reward curiosity, danger, and discovery. Rather than burying you in lore from the outset, the game invites you to uncover its history naturally through exploration, conversation, and experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/208480c83ef1333836c76f71fd98bc7e.poster.avif?t=1787829012\" width=950 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/208480c83ef1333836c76f71fd98bc7e.webm?t=1787829012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/208480c83ef1333836c76f71fd98bc7e.mp4?t=1787829012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people of Daneth are more than quest dispensers. They work, eat, sleep, and follow their own routines. They have personalities, troubles, and secrets of their own, and your actions can shape how their stories unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/778b6017aad0237ccc3575890656c590.poster.avif?t=1787829012\" width=950 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/778b6017aad0237ccc3575890656c590.webm?t=1787829012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/778b6017aad0237ccc3575890656c590.mp4?t=1787829012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a dark and grounded RPG that does not shy away from cruelty, cost, and unsettling choices. It is also a game built with a deep love for the classics: hand-crafted worlds, dangerous exploration, memorable characters, real-time combat, and the satisfaction of slowly carving your own path. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hand-crafted world with seamless exploration, day and night cycles, and changing weather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark fantasy setting focused on vengeance, survival, and difficult choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear progression with strong player freedom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs with branching dialogue, daily routines, and personal stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time combat with no transition to a separate battle screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Towns, wilderness, caves, and dungeons across the kingdom of Daneth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character growth through combat, magic, equipment, and discovery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic RPG spirit with a grounded modern presentation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;Sails on the horizon... Why they came, we did not know... Destruction, chains...&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Code of The Savage</strong> is a dark fantasy RPG about vengeance, survival, and carving your own path through a brutal world. After escaping a slave ship, you wash ashore in chains on the island kingdom of Daneth. Alone and hunted, you must fight to survive in a land where cruelty is common and easy answers are rare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/243e2a952f43e86246c2cf804bdffed2.poster.avif?t=1787829012\" width=950 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/243e2a952f43e86246c2cf804bdffed2.webm?t=1787829012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/243e2a952f43e86246c2cf804bdffed2.mp4?t=1787829012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the great RPGs of the 80s and 90s, Code of The Savage combines classic non-linear exploration with a modern presentation. The world of Daneth is hand-crafted and designed to reward curiosity, danger, and discovery. Rather than burying you in lore from the outset, the game invites you to uncover its history naturally through exploration, conversation, and experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/208480c83ef1333836c76f71fd98bc7e.poster.avif?t=1787829012\" width=950 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/208480c83ef1333836c76f71fd98bc7e.webm?t=1787829012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/208480c83ef1333836c76f71fd98bc7e.mp4?t=1787829012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people of Daneth are more than quest dispensers. They work, eat, sleep, and follow their own routines. They have personalities, troubles, and secrets of their own, and your actions can shape how their stories unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/778b6017aad0237ccc3575890656c590.poster.avif?t=1787829012\" width=950 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/778b6017aad0237ccc3575890656c590.webm?t=1787829012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/extras/778b6017aad0237ccc3575890656c590.mp4?t=1787829012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a dark and grounded RPG that does not shy away from cruelty, cost, and unsettling choices. It is also a game built with a deep love for the classics: hand-crafted worlds, dangerous exploration, memorable characters, real-time combat, and the satisfaction of slowly carving your own path. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hand-crafted world with seamless exploration, day and night cycles, and changing weather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark fantasy setting focused on vengeance, survival, and difficult choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-linear progression with strong player freedom</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs with branching dialogue, daily routines, and personal stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time combat with no transition to a separate battle screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Towns, wilderness, caves, and dungeons across the kingdom of Daneth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character growth through combat, magic, equipment, and discovery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A classic RPG spirit with a grounded modern presentation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Escape a slave ship and wash ashore in chains in a brutal, handcrafted kingdom. Code of The Savage is a dark fantasy open-world RPG inspired by the classics, where exploration, survival, NPC interaction, and the consequences of your choices shape your path.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/71b26dae5d5379fad79020979dc94b20ed25b3a9/header.jpg?t=1787829012", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/1524ba646d645c3fe3d7bedd486228833130806d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787829012", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/1524ba646d645c3fe3d7bedd486228833130806d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787829012", "website": "https://www.codeofthesavage.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia or AMD</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5, i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia or AMD</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Geoff Jones"], "publishers": ["Independent"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 79, "description": "Save Anytime"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "3", "description": "RPG"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/65664c421b6e91465a3492306f028792db7a83af/ss_65664c421b6e91465a3492306f028792db7a83af.600x338.jpg?t=1787829012", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/65664c421b6e91465a3492306f028792db7a83af/ss_65664c421b6e91465a3492306f028792db7a83af.1920x1080.jpg?t=1787829012"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673100/f5807dac8cdd6d1b4eca5094e0bcdd11bb9dc5c7/